  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 401.04 Approval of Plan. The parolee's plan shall be forwarded to the supervising parole officer for investigation and approval. The executive assistant or designee shall notify the inmate in writing of any problems with the parole plan that shall be resolved prior to release.\n\nSource. #5685, eff 8-16-93; ss by #7070, INTERIM, eff 8-12-99, EXPIRES: 12-10-99; ss by #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9255, eff 9-6-08, EXPIRED: 9-6-16\n\nNew. #12158, eff 4-7-17",
